Description: Hayabusa v4.1+ offline DFIR timeline (CSV + JSONL); does not replace stock GitHub csv-timeline module
Category: EventLogs
Author: KapeIR
Version: 1.0
Id: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-a012-3456789abc01
BinaryUrl: https://github.com/Yamato-Security/hayabusa/releases
ExportFormat: csv
Processors:
    -
        Executable: hayabusa\hayabusa.exe
        CommandLine: dfir-timeline -d %sourceDirectory% -p standard -w -q -U -o %destinationDirectory%\hayabusa_events_offline_v41.csv
        ExportFormat: csv
    -
        Executable: hayabusa\hayabusa.exe
        CommandLine: dfir-timeline -d %sourceDirectory% -p standard -w -q -U -t jsonl -o %destinationDirectory%\hayabusa_events_offline_v41.jsonl
        ExportFormat: json

# Documentation
# Local copy for Hayabusa 4.1+ (stock hayabusa_OfflineEventLogs.mkape still uses csv-timeline / --UTC).
# CLI: csv-timeline → dfir-timeline; --UTC → -U.
# Use after collecting EventLogs / CombinedLogs (msource = EVTX tree).
# Requires Modules\bin\hayabusa\hayabusa.exe + config\ + rules\.
